+# Caveman sling kit
+
+The legacy Caveman combat policy can fire identified, non-cursed flint or rocks from a
+sling. NetHack’s range and recoil rules determine the lane checked for friendly fire.
+The inventory sorter can keep a matched sling and up to ten stones after essentials.
+
 # zLeadersSeed812011 (Claude, 2026-10-26)
 
 Identity router. Default base/ = github.com/daglar-dragomirov/nethacker@eab9a9c4f4e09bce096d5762e895fec51b63784d (unmodified).
